or_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Resolved by Gerrit 2949: uv.lock now pins httpx2/httpcore2 2.12.0. Verified with uv lock --check, pip-audit absence check for CVE-2026-84379/84380/84382, dependency_audit.py gate --lane release --no-enrich, and make verify PYTEST_WORKERS=2 with GIT_CONFIG_* unset.","timestamp":1789011046737809001}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1788925021633243333,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"544ce3fa-3efc-485b-b1e0-baa2ecb48fc4","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"ba70-a64e-c59b-489c"},{"link_uuid":"62d3f203-bb59-44b8-8828-363fce883f3d","provenance":"derived","relation":"caused_by","target_id":"ce5d-d352-9511-47bc"}],"description":"# Outstanding dependency advisory on `main`\n\nThe scheduled dependency-advisory lane found CRITICAL/HIGH advisories against the committed lock. Per bug `63e8`, this does NOT block merges or Gerrit submit for changes that leave the dependency map alone — it blocks **releases**, and it is owned here rather than by whoever happens to have a change in flight.\n\n- **Advisories:** CVE-2026-84379,CVE-2026-84380,CVE-2026-84382\n- **Detail:** CVE-2026-84379 (httpx2 2.10.0, HIGH); CVE-2026-84380 (httpx2 2.10.0, HIGH); CVE-2026-84382 (httpx2 2.10.0, HIGH)\n- **Detected at:** 2026-09-09T03:36:36Z\n- **Run:** https://github.com/navapbc/rebar/actions/runs/34307568070\n\n## Remediation\n\nFollow `docs/dependency-advisory-runbook.md`: upgrade the direct dependency first; if an upstream cap blocks that, `override-dependencies` with a recorded justification; then track the upstream fix so the override can be removed. `constraint-dependencies` cannot express this — it only NARROWS, and returns UNSATISFIABLE as its expected output.\n\nThis ticket auto-closes when the advisory clears.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [x] The locked environment no longer reports CVE-2026-84379, CVE-2026-84380, or CVE-2026-84382 against `httpx2`.\n- [x] The dependency resolver either upgrades `httpx2` to a fixed release (2.12.0 or newer) or records a justified temporary override if an upstream cap makes that impossible.\n- [x] Dependency-map changes are limited to the advisory remediation and keep the existing agents/provider dependency seams working.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Run `uv lock --check` after the lock update.\n- Run `uv sync --locked --extra dev` so the local environment matches the committed lock.\n- Run `pip-audit --format json --progress-spinner off` and confirm the cited CVEs are absent; additionally run `python scripts/dependency_audit.py gate --lane release --no-enrich` to exercise the repo advisory gate.\n- Run `GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null GIT_CONFIG_SYSTEM=/dev/null make verify PYTEST_WORKERS=2` before push, dropping to `PYTEST_WORKERS=1` only if the run dies for low memory.\n","detected_by":"dependency-advisory-canary","env_id":"e2e76687-3ef9-48e1-83c6-52f753249d65","file_impact":[{"path":"uv.lock","reason":"Update the pinned dependency closure so httpx2 resolves to a non-vulnerable fixed release."},{"path":"pyproject.toml","reason":"Only if the resolver needs an explicit direct floor or uv override to reach the fixed httpx2 release."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["relates_to","ba70-a64e-c59b-489c"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"a945ede3-b362-4d22-a6af-f949f2259e94","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":["dependency-advisory-alert"],"ticket_id":"60e2-6183-cd5a-4499","ticket_type":"bug","title":"[dependency-advisory] outstanding advisory on main: CVE-2026-84379,CVE-2026-84380,CVE-2026-84382","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["f61d9a03-42c0-4d12-90e6-0da6753e4577","8220b4b1-6c7d-4835-b9c1-4b2f67577dd2","523bb08f-db47-41a1-a324-bec87db56704","73f4c953-08a8-42b6-9b02-cc58bd65c565","c5